    "because": "C7 — the drain is round-robin across ports, one entry per port per pass (node.ts :572-609). p sends true then false; q sends true then false; And sees (true,true) then (false,false), turns true and back, and the Counter downstream of Value Changed reads 3. A target that delivers synchronously in stimulus order (p on, p off, q on, q off) never forms the (true,true) pair: And stays false and the Counter stays at 1. That is CONTRACT.md Part 2's one intentional divergence, asserted as a difference on the export.",
